# "Syr Ginger has trample, hexproof, and haste as long as an opponent controls a planeswalker." Bot2 casts Liliana of the Veil on turn 2. On turn 3 Bot1 casts
# Syr Ginger with two Moxen: she has Trample; Hexproof; Haste (CR 604.1, 613.1f), so Bot2's Lightning Bolt cannot target her (CR 702.11b) and she attacks the turn she
# arrives (CR 702.10b), hitting Liliana for 3, which empties her loyalty (CR 306.9). With no planeswalker left Syr Ginger has none of the three keywords, and the Bolt
# Bot2 casts in the second main phase (paid with Black Lotus; the Ruby is tapped from the refusal) kills her (3/1).

